  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-16-changes\"></a>\n\n### Changes\n\n- `pipx ensurepath` no longer claims it added the binary directories to PATH when they were already there; the summary now says so and points at `--force` for adding them again ([#2431](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2431)) by @AP24110011695 and @gaborbernat.\n\n<a name=\"release-1-18-16-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Rebuild shared pip environments created with Python older than 3.10, and refresh existing applications' references to the rebuilt environment before running their installers ([#2437](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2437)) by @gaborbernat. ([#2435](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/issues/2435))\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.16/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.15...1.18.16)\n",
